<title>HONG KONG: Kodak reshuffles Greater China managers.</title>
<headline>Kodak reshuffles Greater China managers.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastman Kodak Co said on Friday Wilbur Prezzano, vice chairman of the company and chairman and president of its Greater China Region, would retire January 1.</p>
<p>Patrick Siewert, currently vice president of the group and deputy chairman of its Greater China Region, was appointed chairman and president of the Greater China Region.</p>
<p>David Swift, also a vice president of the company, was appointed vice chairman of the Greater China Region.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
